    "片段由 SponsorBlock 社群標記。查詢時只送出影片 ID 雜湊的前 4 碼到 sponsor.ajay.app。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Segments are marked by the SponsorBlock community. Lookups send only the first 4 characters of the video ID's hash to sponsor.ajay.app."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "区間は SponsorBlock のコミュニティが登録しています。問い合わせでは動画 ID のハッシュの先頭 4 文字だけを sponsor.ajay.app に送ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片段由 SponsorBlock 社区标记。查询时只发送视频 ID 哈希的前 4 位到 sponsor.ajay.app。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片段由 SponsorBlock 社群標記。查詢時只送出影片 ID 雜湊的前 4 碼到 sponsor.ajay.app。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
